msgid "**C4 Injection before render:** the `sys-front-inj-*` roles accumulate `inj_enabled` and `webserver_csp_hashes_extra_by_vhost` that the vhost render consumes (`inj-all:13-51`, `front-proxy:95`); Matomo injection needs Matomo deployed and its token present (`sys-front-inj-matomo/tasks/main.yml:10-27`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**C5 Probe after reload:** front-proxy probes each vhost right after the reload (`:111-154`); application tasks that run after the stack need their vhost live (BigBlueButton Greenlight wait, Matomo API calls)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**C6 Front proxy flush:** front-proxy's `meta: flush_handlers` (`:129-130,152-154`) flushes every pending handler of the play; this is why `svc-ai-mcp-adapter/tasks/instance.yml:10-16` notifies nothing during staging."
msgstr ""

msgid "**C7 Placement:** front-proxy runs on the OpenResty host via delegate plus `run_once` (`full:21-23`); compose prep and up only where `IS_STACK_HOST` (`sys-svc-compose/tasks/main.yml:25-34`, `group_vars/all/18_swarm.yml:11-19`); NFS subdirs on every swarm node (`main.yml:29-30`); swarm deploys through a notify (`utils/up.yml:44-49`); dedicated-DB realign on `STACK_HOST` with `run_once`; the Postgres container is re-resolved per node (`svc-db-postgres/tasks/01_init.yml:16`)."
