app password (Settings, Security, Devices & sessions). The app password the deploy mints for the MCP account is such a device token, which Nextcloud exempts from the second factor. `passkey` sets `auth.webauthn.enabled` (\"Log in with a device\"). OIDC account creation stays governed by `oidc_login_disable_registration`, and Nextcloud has no local self-registration."
