msgid "**Role Mapping:** With SSO, every login sets the OpenCloud role from the Keycloak realm roles: members of the ``administrator``, ``spaceadmin`` and ``guest`` role groups become ``admin``, ``spaceadmin`` and ``user-light``, and every other realm user signs in as ``user`` through ``default-roles-<realm>``. Without SSO, every account signs in as ``user``."
