msgid "A lint keeps `meta/forms.yml` and the role's convergence in step: every field the role converges is declared, and every declared field is converged."
msgstr ""

msgid "A list of external links relevant to the software or the deployment. Link text MUST be a descriptive label or the domain name. Never use the full URL."
