msgid "A path outside ``roles/<name>/`` that lies under ``tests/`` or is a Markdown or reStructuredText file reaches no deploy and is left out, the skip rule of ``scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh``. Of the rest, a file the inventory bakes in takes a reinstall, because ``mode=update`` reuses the inventory and would test the old include set. A diff that stays inside the app role, outside its shared meta files, its ``test.env`` template and its CLI test files, takes a role sync. Everything else takes ``mode=update``."
