msgid "Every vhost of a shared consumer marked ``public`` also serves its bucket under ``/_infinito/objstore/<bucket>/``, and ``lookup('objstore', application_id, 'relative_url')`` returns that host-relative base for URLs a browser loads. The route passes ``GET`` and ``HEAD`` for object keys only: it answers ``404`` for a path ending in ``/``, drops the query string and the ``Authorization`` and ``Cookie`` headers, and sends the request over the loopback to the ``api.seaweedfs.s3.*`` vhost. Responses carry ``X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`` and a ``sandbox`` Content Security Policy. A consumer without ``public: true`` or in embedded mode gets an empty ``relative_url`` and no route."
