msgid "Grafana reads Loki over the shared network of the ``loki`` service bond (``http://loki:3100``). The Loki API and the gateway also bind to the local ports ``services.loki.ports.local.loki`` and ``services.gateway.ports.local.push``, for the front proxy and the role test."
