msgid "MUST be deployed on the public [infinito.nexus](https://infinito.nexus/) production instance and serving real traffic. The [infinito.nexus](https://infinito.nexus/) deploy is the project's burn-in environment for release-candidate roles; coverage gaps that only surface against real users get caught here before the role graduates to `stable`."
