msgid "Under ``mailbox``, a user created at runtime (admin console, admin API, registration) gets its LDAP ``mail`` from the `RBAC sync timer <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/README.md>`__, which runs every 15 minutes (``SYS_SCHEDULE_MAINTANANCE_RBAC_SYNC``). Until its next run the user has no ``mailbox`` attribute and no ``email`` claim. The timer sets ``mail`` only on entries that hold none."
