msgid "``oidc``: baseline admin OIDC round-trip, the three Single-Site RBAC scenarios (subscriber/editor/administrator), the Multisite scenarios (bootstrap super-admin kept, network-administrator grant and revoke, per-site Editor on the primary and on a child site only, own site created, archived and restored through site-owner) and the profile sync and read-only scenario."
