msgid "``onion_peers=``, the same pin as the SSO one in the other direction: URLs or hosts the container itself calls server to server. Keycloak delivers back-channel logout tokens to an application's own origin, which on an onion deployment is a ``.onion`` name its container cannot resolve, so each onion peer is pinned to the proxy that serves its vhost. Clearnet peers pass."
