msgid "``roles`` lists every role the plan accounts for. Each sits in the T3 whitelist or in a cut of tier ``all``, and the baseline (what ``scripts/meta/resolve/diff/affected_roles.sh`` widens the same diff to) is always a subset of the two: the classifier may narrow the fail-safe rule, but only by naming each role it leaves out and the paths that let it. Cuts of a narrower tier (``local``, ``T0``, ``T1``, ``T2``) name what a local tier leaves to a later one."
