msgid "``saml`` is a licence-gated Mattermost Enterprise feature, not a marketplace plugin. It is declared so the integration is discoverable and stays off; ``tasks/addons/saml.yml`` fails the play if it is switched on. The free tier reaches Keycloak over the OIDC path described above."
