msgid "``services.litellm.validation.workers`` bounds concurrency to three requests by default. Authentication runs first; inference jobs for authenticated consumers then run in a thread pool. Results retain declaration order, and failures are reported after all jobs finish. Set workers to ``1`` for sequential checks. Concurrency does not increase provider quotas or reduce the number of probes."
