msgid "`tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ applies the settings, the administrator and its LDAP link only when the digest of its sources, its inputs and the state OpenProject holds differs from the stamp ``admin-provision.sha256`` in the instance directory. Set ``services.openproject.admin.force`` to ``true`` to run it regardless."
